# Backend conventions

- All metric math lives in `supabase/functions/_shared/engine` as pure functions with Deno tests. No math in SQL views or the app.
- Every metric carries `provenance`, `method`, `window_start`, `window_end`.
- Engine output for maya must equal the payloads in `docs/05-BACKEND-SCHEMA.md` §5 exactly; keep a snapshot test for it.
- RLS on every table. Service role key only inside Edge Functions and `seed.ts`.
- Migrations are append-only in `supabase/migrations/`. Test with `supabase db reset`.
- `web/` has exactly one public route, `/s/[slug]`, reading only `share_snapshots` where `revoked = false`.
